ocument-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9074543</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit> </patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1176823A1</text><sources><source name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations> </citations> </technical-data> <parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FLUENCY RES &amp; DEV CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOYANAGI YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIIGATA SEIMITSU CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TORAICHI KAZUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FLUENCY RESEARCH &amp; DEVELOPMENT CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOYANAGI, YUKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIIGATA SEIMITSU CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TORAICHI, KAZUO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOYANAGI YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TORAICHI KAZUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOYANAGI, YUKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TORAICHI, KAZUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An image processing circuit capable of carrying out high-speed processing and improving the horizontal and vertical resolutions even with its simple structure.  The pixel values a to i of a total of nine pixels, three pixels in the horizontal direction along a scanning line by three pixels in the vertical direction in which the line and adjacent lines are abreast, are extracted by a pixel value extracting section.  The pixel values A1 to A4 of four pixels (Q1 to Q4) generated additionally around the center pixel (P5) are determined by calculation by a pixel value calculating section.  These pixel values are outputted in units of one scanning line by correlating them with two scanning lines by a pixel value output section.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Circuit de traitement d'image capable d'exécuter un traitement extrêmement rapide et d'améliorer les résolutions horizontales et verticales en dépit de sa structure simplifiée. On extrait au moyen d'une section d'extraction de valeurs de pixel les valeurs de pixel de a à i d'un total de neuf pixels, trois pixels dans le sens horizontal le long d'une ligne de balayage par trois pixels dans le sens vertical dans lequel la ligne et les lignes contiguës sont situées côte-à-côte. On détermine les valeurs de pixel A1 à A4 de quatre pixels (Q1 à Q4) générés additionnellement autour du pixel central (P5), au moyen d'un calcul effectué par une section de calcul de valeurs de pixel. On sort ces valeurs de pixel en unités d'une ligne de balayage, ce qui consiste à les mettre en corrélation avec deux lignes de balayage au moyen d'une section de sortie de valeurs de pixel.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third